  "description": "Open-source FHIR server built in C# by Firely and now maintained by Incendi. Supports FHIR R4 and STU3, available as NuGet packages or Docker images. Validated through HL7 WGM Connectathons. BSD-3-Clause, 278 stars, v2.4.1-r4 (April 2026). Community maintained with Discord support channel.",
