  "mach:judgementReason": "Connectathon-validated open-source FHIR server in C#, originally by Firely and now maintained by Incendi. BSD-3-Clause, R4 and STU3 support, Docker deployment. Assess rather than Adopt due to smaller community (278 stars) compared to HAPI FHIR. Good fit for teams in the .NET/C# ecosystem who want a community-governed alternative to Microsoft's FHIR Server.",
